                "loc": "LEV.23.26+LEV.23.27+LEV.23.28+LEV.23.29+LEV.23.30+LEV.23.31+LEV.23.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 23.26-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.7+NUM.29.8+NUM.29.9+NUM.29.10+NUM.29.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 29.7-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Man bibedo cik matwal botwu, ni, i dwe me abiro, i nino dwe me aparre, wubikumo ki toncwiny. Pe wubitiyo tic mo, kadi anywalli me lobo, kadi labedo ma bedo i kinwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien i nino meno aye gibitimo iye gin lakwany bal ki i komwu me lonyowu; myero wubed ma wulonnye i nyim Rwot ki i kom balwu ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En aye bedo botwu cabit me yweyo mot, ci wubikumo ki toncwiny; man aye cik ma bedo matwal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajwaka ma giwiro ki moo ka giketo en i dog ticce me bedo ajwaka, kun leyo kaka wonne, bitimo gin lakwany bal, kun ruko boŋŋi aruka maleŋ me boŋo camanini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En bitimo gin lakwany bal ki i kom kabedo maleŋ, dok bitimo gin lakwany bal ki i kom kema me wratte ki i kom keno tyer, Ka dok bitimo gin lakwany bal ki i kom ajwagi, ki i kom jo ducu mucokke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man bibedo cik botwu matwal, ni, myero gitim gin lakwany bal ki i kom jo Icrael i mwaka acel kicel, pi balgi ducu.” Ci Moses otimo kit ma Rwot ocike kwede.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
